    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d87">

                <pb facs="0094" n="84" xml:id="pg84"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.34553B/11–2944</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Acting Secretary of State to President
                        Roosevelt </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-11-29">November 29, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The final agreement<anchor n="32" xml:id="d87-f1"/> for the additional air base
                    in Santa Maria, Azores, was signed yesterday and the Portuguese Government has
                    instructed the Azores authorities to turn the base over to the United States
                    Army for immediate use.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. R. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius, Jr.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d87-f1" n="32" xml:id="d87-f1-content">
                <p>For text of exchange of notes, agreement, and supplementary exchange of notes
                    signed at Lisbon, November 28, 1944. see Department of State, Treaties and Other
                    International Acts Series No. 2338, or 2 UST (pt. 2) 2124.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
